    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/79f86fbd90de3f968c445060535e0ff5.webp?t=1732209848\" /></div><br>DarkTimes is a twin-stick shooter with a twist: You can control <strong>Anne</strong> and <strong>Friend</strong>, her mystical crow simultaneously. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/9a7a008f7e050b6e0fe09fc4b262e517.poster.avif?t=1732209848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/9a7a008f7e050b6e0fe09fc4b262e517.webm?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/9a7a008f7e050b6e0fe09fc4b262e517.mp4?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/2ebca581f25aed1cd0e7c0dc1749a552.webp?t=1732209848\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/793ddca59886204a72e274ecb95160b4.poster.avif?t=1732209848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/793ddca59886204a72e274ecb95160b4.webm?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/793ddca59886204a72e274ecb95160b4.mp4?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Use <strong>Friend</strong> as a grappling hook to move fast and surprise your foes in a <strong>skilled based platforming gameplay</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/53775ae8b3b4b37281c639ccc9cc0ff2.webp?t=1732209848\" /></div><br>Anne has been monster huntress for the past decade. She found love, got pregnant and decided to quit. But<strong> her newborn and partner are missing</strong>.<br>Gear up one last time, and go on a quest to<strong> get them back, no matter the cost</strong>.<br><br>Find your way across a <strong>distorted version of 1880's Louisiana's</strong> infested woods, swamps and lost villages. Fight against<strong> monsters and dark magic</strong> inspired by <strong>Louisiana's legends and lore</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/7a50b2cde0c2aaae03569e0e4d5453ca.poster.avif?t=1732209848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/7a50b2cde0c2aaae03569e0e4d5453ca.webm?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/7a50b2cde0c2aaae03569e0e4d5453ca.mp4?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/79f86fbd90de3f968c445060535e0ff5.webp?t=1732209848\" /></div><br>DarkTimes is a twin-stick shooter with a twist: You can control <strong>Anne</strong> and <strong>Friend</strong>, her mystical crow simultaneously. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/9a7a008f7e050b6e0fe09fc4b262e517.poster.avif?t=1732209848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/9a7a008f7e050b6e0fe09fc4b262e517.webm?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/9a7a008f7e050b6e0fe09fc4b262e517.mp4?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/2ebca581f25aed1cd0e7c0dc1749a552.webp?t=1732209848\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/793ddca59886204a72e274ecb95160b4.poster.avif?t=1732209848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/793ddca59886204a72e274ecb95160b4.webm?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/793ddca59886204a72e274ecb95160b4.mp4?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Use <strong>Friend</strong> as a grappling hook to move fast and surprise your foes in a <strong>skilled based platforming gameplay</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/53775ae8b3b4b37281c639ccc9cc0ff2.webp?t=1732209848\" /></div><br>Anne has been monster huntress for the past decade. She found love, got pregnant and decided to quit. But<strong> her newborn and partner are missing</strong>.<br>Gear up one last time, and go on a quest to<strong> get them back, no matter the cost</strong>.<br><br>Find your way across a <strong>distorted version of 1880's Louisiana's</strong> infested woods, swamps and lost villages. Fight against<strong> monsters and dark magic</strong> inspired by <strong>Louisiana's legends and lore</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/7a50b2cde0c2aaae03569e0e4d5453ca.poster.avif?t=1732209848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/7a50b2cde0c2aaae03569e0e4d5453ca.webm?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737530/extras/7a50b2cde0c2aaae03569e0e4d5453ca.mp4?t=1732209848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "DarkTimes is a 3D twin-stick action platformer, where you can use two weapons to aim two directions simultaneously. shoot, dash, stun, bullet time to defeat hordes of monsters. He stole your daughter, get her back.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French",
    "reviews": "\u201cDarkTimes is very different as it is a much slower experience, taking in that horror atmosphere that I found interesting. Instead of having 20 to 30 enemies coming at Annie, it was more like 10 at the max trying to use everything at my disposal because I needed to reload after every seven shots. It made me play more tactically than I was used to with this type of game.\u201d<br>Syndicate Y<br><br>\u201cThe idea to shoot from different angles using different guns is really unique, and the ability to do that while you are in mid-action is really challenging and interesting to see working inside the game.\u201d<br>G.Round<br>",
